                        <h4 data-id="349" class="text-sm font-bold text-teal mb-3">What the Evidence Shows</h4>
                        <ul data-id="350" class="text-sm text-txt-muted space-y-2">
                            <li data-id="351" class="flex items-start gap-2"> ACP guidelines: imaging NOT recommended without red flags</li>
