                    <p data-id="365" class="text-sm text-txt-muted leading-relaxed">While imaging can feel reassuring, current clinical guidelines do not recommend routine imaging for acute non-specific low back pain without red flags. Joe's presentation had none. The degenerative changes found are extremely common and are NOT necessarily the source of acute pain. Conservative management should still be initiated.</p>
